
/*
 * Implements semantic validation for field access on range values in Ymir.
 *
 * Supported fields:
 *   - fst       — start of the range
 *   - scd       — end of the range
 *   - step      — step value(may be negative)
 *   - contains  — inclusiveness flag(true for ...)
 *   - stepBy    — method-like field returning a delegate for step adjustment
 *   - reverse   — returns a reversed range
 *   - len       — number of iterations in the range
 *
 *
 * This module is invoked by FieldValidation when the left operand is a RangeType.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::value::operator::fields::range
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/value/operator/fields/range.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-04-18
 * @Copyright(C) 2021–2026 GNU-Ymir
 * @License
 *   ```text
